    "hyprland": "Hyprland is configured with custom Tron window rules. Super+Q closes window, Super+S opens Settings, Super+A opens AI Assistant, Super+Return opens terminal, Super+Shift+S captures screenshot.",
    "kortex-ctl": "Unified management CLI. Subcommands: 'profile <eco|balanced|overdrive>', 'theme <mono|amber|matrix|cyan>', 'layout <reset|default>', 'kis' for telemetry.",
